  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t23",
   "x": 404,
   "y": 426,
   "text": "the gap: the judge says pass, ground truth does not",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "strokeColor": "#b42318"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t24",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 540,
   "text": "WHY THE ERROR HIDES",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b25",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 568,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 80,
   "backgroundColor": "#e6ebf1",
   "strokeColor": "#3f4c5f",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "A noisy judge is inconsistent.\nIt announces itself.",
    "fontSize": 16,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#1f2a3a"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b26",
   "x": 480,
   "y": 568,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 80,
   "backgroundColor": "#fbe0e0",
   "strokeColor": "#b42318",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "A generous judge reads as good news.\nGood news is rarely audited.",
    "fontSize": 16,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#7a1a12"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t27",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 662,
   "text": "A judge that shares lineage, training or framing with what it judges has correlated errors. They do not cancel; they confirm.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "strokeColor": "#475569"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b28",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 215,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 190,
   "backgroundColor": "#1f1b17",
   "strokeColor": "#4a3f35",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t29",
   "x": 962,
   "y": 233,
   "text": "#1250 · Browserbase · 00:04:16",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#fdba74"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t30",
   "x": 962,
   "y": 265,
   "text": "\"there's a huge gap between\n what the existing verifiers say\n and what is actually the\n ground truth.\"",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#f5ede4"
  },
  {
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "b31",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 440,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 120,
   "backgroundColor": "#ea580c",
   "strokeColor": "#9a3412",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "A verifier is a model\nwith opinions. Audit it.",
    "fontSize": 22,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#ffffff"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
